      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-28T09:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was a pretty decent episode- it’s quite nice to have a lens to focus on what motivates and drives a character in a bit more depth. We’ve had the run down of what happened to these characters in decades of (fictional) comics, but this gives a bit of insight into Unity, so I feel like I’ve learnt something.</p>\n<p>I’d definitely be up for these types of episodes again.</p>",
